# REST

### Login
POST http://localhost:9093/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "",
    "password": "",
    "rememberMe": true
}

### Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9093/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": ""
}

### Profile
GET http://localhost:9093/admin/users/me
Authorization: Bearer <token>